# # /epiphoto/
#
# https://w3id.org/epiphoto/ redirects to https://epiphoto.org/
# https://w3id.org/epiphoto/<id> redirects to https://epiphoto.org/<id>
#
# An identifier under this namespace names a person or a thing, not a page;
# it is answered with 303 See Other, to the page about it.
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Claudio Caviglia
# info@epiphoto.org
# GitHub username: claudiocaviglia63-SAV

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^$ https://epiphoto.org/ [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^(.+)$ https://epiphoto.org/$1 [R=303,L]
